的梳化扔下樓，差點砸到人。（翻攝自X@adam_krus）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260531/1137736042548432896352986.jpeg/kdSu4jW6Zp_Lt_aa-KWPJ7RbcEu5xXBX82Gy9vNhsvY\"/><figcaption>一名英國16歲少年在商場將15kg的梳化扔下樓，差點砸到人。（翻攝自X@adam_krus）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一名英國16歲少年在商場將15kg的梳化扔下樓，差點砸到人。（翻攝自X@adam_krus）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260531/1137736044549246976425931.jpeg/vqk-GnAqxzPaYVUnmLCVzZugDRajXM5InUTPh51Ez4c\"/><figcaption>一名英國16歲少年在商場將15kg的梳化扔下樓，差點砸到人。（翻攝自X@adam_krus）</figcaption></figure><p>延伸閲讀：</p><p>開播即暴動！近年漫改韓劇排行曝　《鐵拳教育》狂捲14萬聲量奪冠</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T08:00:04.268473+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1203,"images":14,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T07:42:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T10:37:59.044954+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T07:57:35.432898+00:00","content_hash":"00ae6308b016f128dcd9b1d78c391d6b9576687ddcab6aea383516ffaa38a6f3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}